{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現代人最鍾意食飯時玩手機，但若果與長輩同枱食飯也玩手機，必定會被重重責備！要知道食飯也講究基本餐桌禮儀，阿媽教落「飛象過河」、「餓狗搶食」都是大忌，丟臉事小，畀人鬧冇家教事大。有網民曾以食飯禮儀為題在Facebook群組展開討論，不少人提到很多小時候由父母教導的餐桌禮儀都被遺忘，令後生仔做出失禮的餐桌行為，令人難以接受！</p><figure><img alt=\"（《千與千尋》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210706/489144055167455232015926.jpeg/xisqoOU3RSYC2iR4P9YG5k2MWAcgALyGWv26K1r9uis\"/><figcaption>（《千與千尋》劇照）</figcaption></figure><p>有網民曾在Facebook群組 「只談舊事，不談政治 （香港懷舊廊）」發文，講起食飯時各種禮儀，有人話夾餸、斟茶俾人先是基本，有人指現時後生仔、小朋友個個都機不離手，食飯前後嗌人等禮貌已經蕩然無存。</p><p>帖文吸引逾200個網民讚好及240多個留言，不少人批評現代人完全唔識禮貌，連身為長輩的一眾家長都忘記了這些禮儀，完全做唔到「以身作則」。😭😭飛象過河、餓狗搶食是否好常見？按下圖即睇網民熱數9大超失禮餐桌行為 👇👇</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210706/489156053833879552736150.jpeg/qy2si06v4_pOTuP0e2NHFdAHQXyxroa2scTUyLHE1Mg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210706/489156056392536064905762.jpeg/GIoRajcTRv9LBa6owsNicTLyvdVFy9kRtJ8DwLSfA8A\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210706/489156058879889408156490.jpeg/Ni8M7IROQuvk9Uy-VDUV1za_lqw-EFo2_zxHwf88R8E\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210706/489156061476294656635189.jpeg/Uhz6hPjGK5Qt3xPuWrp9aAb0f-GHjwIBrQkF760JBe8\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210706/489156063670046720329048.jpeg/C7R3CtJmOvfELJZQkkuVzV00FarhkMVNTswPsE7MD7A\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210706/489156065968656384821653.jpeg/qeaD9SO8wBweDMimj4n6t9fOiJGeXqkuVNXRSlTV0Uo\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210706/489159396794830848568942.jpeg/JokPUQMFtgokfw4aRsTnnMka5fMAqLG4oNJM9KDSTPQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210706/489156070863671296367148.jpeg/7TtwjodSSv8v2DuebHBISSdG-cB0DsvzVXwuGFV8Lhg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210706/489156073288241152098143.jpeg/kp7WVVcJFfEQzOlmBuc1aBsp4pxxYirIZkl9i2ZJfYs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210706/489159276690935808374598.jpeg/AgHvKSO8hqj1xhj__QCRhO4O_PpWvOoNtBQL6bQUC-k\"/><p>知多啲：網民盤點10種食物人越大越鍾意</p><p>小時候揀飲擇食，不吃苦味的食物，又不吃聞起來臭哄哄的食物，但長大後卻會慢慢接受不同口味的食物，就連以前最討厭的苦瓜都覺得不如小時候一樣苦澀。有網民指隨著年紀增長，味覺也會隨著退化，而苦味成為最快退化的味道，因此人越大就越不怕苦，甚至會享受它們帶來的回甘及香氣。😭😭按圖即睇網民熱數10種長大後才會欣賞的食物 👇👇</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210625/485143801820745728876145.jpeg/-pwueSAsu3d0dJFLidzOJ9utJrNQQ2y87qpIB-6qSAc\"/><figure><img alt=\"燒腩仔\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210625/485143803985137664075649.jpeg/XCPLHTJfCBcUUupDLx-OS3e_EEMdW3fEWCbPv1gmz78\"/><figcaption>燒腩仔</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"芝士\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210625/485143806707372032870142.jpeg/iWO6v-Bu7LCxk9V0Uya7m5JgzYEq-uGITXu23k17tt4\"/><figcaption>芝士</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"苦瓜\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210625/485143808854986752416039.jpeg/86FlyKJsuiIru6_EkhBRKRH_vCa7Azp3J6Cxtyegsbc\"/><figcaption>苦瓜</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"咖啡\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210625/485143811208122368901548.jpeg/KomVAEHzn9Z4mEWtCxDUWNXgNjgTrZUjGiCzuxogs7s\"/><figcaption>咖啡</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"茶\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210625/485143813569646592458192.jpeg/AgegsWvizqYM6Ik3rWfrAcVnMXP7MaeWFDlPRBQ5T0Q\"/><figcaption>茶</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蒜蓉\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210625/485143816124108800179425.jpeg/rToCMLsruwMXwKBl9O860eF2XAMoRl0tTBtKs0wbSrM\"/><figcaption>蒜蓉</figcaption></figure><p>想知網民最懷念的美食是甚麼？點擊內文：網民盤點10種食物人越大越鍾意　燒腩仔是極品　有一種隨時食唔返</p><p>（全文完）👉follow 好食玩飛ig ✈️免費睇旅遊飲食攻略</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T02:58:37.185458+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":657,"images":18,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}